Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.83,0:00:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心园)贝… 贝库塔大人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.06,0:00:04.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这到底是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.61,0:00:08.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)哈哈哈… 那个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.31,0:00:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我做的 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.11,0:00:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以说 是虚假的 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.06,0:00:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心园)虚假的 No.卡？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.27,0:00:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.93,0:00:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把这玩意撒到人界去…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.22,0:00:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！ 这虚假 No.卡竟然{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.29,0:00:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有如此惊人的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你去把那玩意撒到人界去。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.66,0:00:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后把快斗和凌牙的 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.93,0:00:40.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我抢过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.49,0:00:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}交给我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.01,0:00:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定把那两人的 No.卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.82,0:00:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛苦…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.45,0:00:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个会拍马屁的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.71,0:00:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听好了？ 这是最后的机会。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.88,0:00:58.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我、我明白。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.69,0:01:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次一定……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.79,0:01:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真拿你没办法。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.29,0:01:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就赐你最后一次机会吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.63,0:01:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，要是成功了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.42,0:01:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你成为七皇之一加入进来也不是不行。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……让我加入七皇！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.22,0:01:19.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.55,0:01:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……感激不尽！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.09,0:01:23.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，海马他们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.41,0:01:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从你同伴那里夺来的 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.74,0:01:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要利用那个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.45,0:01:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算是你这么无能也能打赢那群家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.90,0:01:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（咚·萨赞多）这样一来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.38,0:01:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}地球和阿斯特拉尔世界都要完了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.66,0:02:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，再这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.02,0:02:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可拿不到 No.代码哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.55,0:02:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无所谓。只要让星灵世界消失{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.61,0:02:11.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的目的就能达成。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.24,0:02:20.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从今天凌晨开始爆发的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.75,0:02:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场暴动{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.51,0:02:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}完全没有平息的迹象。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.78,0:02:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)又是暴动啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.02,0:02:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})这几天全世界都在发生呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.75,0:02:31.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)在这颗心之地也是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.75,0:02:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事件频发。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.54,0:02:34.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯茜)喵的 怎么突然…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.09,0:02:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来原因似乎是 No.者。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.71,0:02:39.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家) No.者？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.26,0:02:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.13,0:02:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然不清楚是怎么到手的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.57,0:02:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但得到 No.者的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.13,0:02:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正成为骚动和事件的核心。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.12,0:02:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其数量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.41,0:02:50.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}据说将近100万…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.10,0:02:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡有100万张！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.42,0:02:53.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵的……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.53,0:02:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})不可能吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.28,0:02:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么说来 这就是……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:02:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.06,0:02:58.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.88,0:03:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们几个 没捡到什么奇怪的 No.卡吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.58,0:03:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵有！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连见都没见过呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.84,0:03:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.94,0:03:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)比起那个游马怎么样了乌拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.73,0:03:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这边被交代了不要主动通信。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说曹操曹操到……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.11,0:03:16.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}V哥哥大人好像回来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.21,0:05:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)送游马过去的次元之门关上了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.11,0:05:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯西)那游马岂不是会变成什么样啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.11,0:05:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)不知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.52,0:05:12.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马不会再回来了乌拉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.13,0:05:16.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么会… 那种事我不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.37,0:05:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么… 为什么抛弃了游马乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.52,0:05:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样可不行乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.91,0:05:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂… 德之助 住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.82,0:05:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)没关系的 游马他。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.50,0:05:28.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马绝对会回来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.92,0:05:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.63,0:05:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}至今为止他不都每次都平安回来了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.23,0:05:36.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说得也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.71,0:05:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.49,0:05:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)还带着星光体呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.80,0:05:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(3人)嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.53,0:05:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}美丽… 太美丽了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.05,0:05:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是美丽的友情啊 各位。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.52,0:05:53.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.22,0:05:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Mr.心园！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.01,0:05:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[显示器]但是 你们与
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.96,0:06:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马的再会{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.51,0:06:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永远不可能发生。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 到外面来！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.21,0:06:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心园)你好 各位。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.74,0:06:13.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然很想慢慢叙叙旧{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.65,0:06:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但看来是不行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.78,0:06:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧 海斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.57,0:06:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋……心园！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.67,0:06:22.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么各位请看那边！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.82,0:06:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)什…什么啊!? 那个！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.95,0:06:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}It's show time！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.64,0:06:44.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)巴利安 巴利安 巴利安……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.77,0:06:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身…身体……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.94,0:06:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好重……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.77,0:06:58.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(欧比塔尔7)空间质量发生变化！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.55,0:07:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那道光柱是巴利安世界的能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.18,0:07:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.66,0:07:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 那个是……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.28,0:07:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将巴利安世界与我们的世界连接起来的东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.58,0:07:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}完全正确！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.44,0:07:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奖品是 前往那个世界的永恒之旅。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.82,0:07:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以团体形式 邀请各位！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.69,0:07:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙…… 到底是怎么找到这里的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.22,0:07:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一切都是多亏了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.58,0:07:26.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个世界 分发出去的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.51,0:07:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.47,0:07:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.14,0:07:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心中怀有比常人更强烈的欲望{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又无法抑制那份欲望……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.82,0:07:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心之地)也就是说 被吸引到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.45,0:07:39.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}内心脆弱之人的身边。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.97,0:07:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 拿到手的人会发出特殊的频率。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.44,0:07:46.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我循着那个找过来 就到了这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.59,0:07:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么说来 那个 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.23,0:07:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}持有者就在这里！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.91,0:07:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 你们这帮家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.12,0:07:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才不是还说没拿着吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.84,0:07:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我说了不知道啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.66,0:07:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.92,0:07:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵 喵。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.17,0:08:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.36,0:08:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧 蠢货。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.29,0:08:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 为什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.13,0:08:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…… 我捡到了这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.60,0:08:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有了这个决斗肯定也能变强……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.12,0:08:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）我…… 我。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.29,0:08:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定能帮上游马我是这么想的……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.69,0:08:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……总是什么都做不好呜啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.80,0:08:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以……所以……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.36,0:08:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想帮上忙！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.16,0:08:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那份坚强的心意{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}招来了天大的麻烦。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.94,0:08:41.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.99,0:08:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很快这个世界就会被吞没！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.26,0:08:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心园)被吞没进巴利安世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.71,0:08:51.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得到我们赠予的 No.卡的人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将无法控制
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的欲望与情感{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}化为漆黑的能量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.91,0:08:57.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被吸入连接巴利安世界
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.07,0:09:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与这个世界的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.21,0:09:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}管道之中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.99,0:09:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后成为将彼此不同次元的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.74,0:09:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}互相吸引的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.97,0:09:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。现在两个世界正
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:12.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两个世界正要融合。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.90,0:09:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.71,0:09:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界各地发生的暴动。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.85,0:09:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助君一反常态变得激昂起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.25,0:09:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这么做，目的到底是什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.78,0:09:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.92,0:09:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能推测出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.56,0:09:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安吞噬这个世界一旦融合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈尔特曾经做过的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.11,0:09:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对星幽界的攻击就成为可能。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.80,0:09:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别抢我的台词～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.17,0:09:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实，再这样下去正如那家伙所说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的世界会被巴利安吞噬
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.87,0:09:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}甚至可能消失。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯茜/铁男)德之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)德之助君！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.44,0:09:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连你也就请你成为人柱吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.78,0:09:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Adieu！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.94,0:09:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.39,0:09:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要啊～！德之助～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.76,0:10:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请放心。反正
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.41,0:10:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再过不久，大家都会消失。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.49,0:10:07.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连同这个世界一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.75,0:10:09.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过在那之前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.86,0:10:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}各位所持有的 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.94,0:10:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就全部收下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.34,0:10:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就用武力来抢试试看啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.97,0:10:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.27,0:10:22.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用你说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.21,0:10:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也打算用武力、用蛮力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.80,0:10:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你打趴下。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.49,0:10:26.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你一路捧成
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.98,0:10:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.猎人这份恩情你忘了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.67,0:10:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这个叛徒！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.28,0:10:33.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对你这种人谈什么恩情……真让人恶心。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.93,0:10:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首先，就凭你这种货色
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.22,0:10:37.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可没记得自己当过杂鱼的手下。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.74,0:10:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闭嘴 闭嘴 闭嘴～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.65,0:10:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 决斗吧～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.61,0:10:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正合我意。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.18,0:10:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗模式 光子变换。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.37,0:10:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天一定要 把你送进地狱。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.98,0:10:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.02,0:11:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(２人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.53,0:11:21.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很难受吧 海马。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.43,0:11:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个世界正在逐渐变成屏障世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.44,0:11:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 地上的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.09,0:11:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都拥有和屏障场地相同的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.85,0:11:34.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行决斗的你 尤其{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.03,0:11:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该能感受到肉体上的痛苦！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.81,0:11:41.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对付你 正好是个合适的 handicap。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.33,0:11:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 顺便当作 handicap先攻也归我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.82,0:11:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.30,0:11:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 拟态蝇！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.19,0:11:58.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再从手牌发动 魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.42,0:12:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}地狱多重繁殖！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.98,0:12:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.56,0:12:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有等级2以下的怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.65,0:12:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将手牌中相同的怪兽全部特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.75,0:12:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 2只拟态蝇！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再接着发动拟态蝇的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.26,0:12:20.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将所有怪兽的等级{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.51,0:12:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成2倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上还有2只相同的怪兽……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.22,0:12:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 效果也……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.16,0:12:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.51,0:12:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上怪兽的等级{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.31,0:12:32.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还能再2次
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.13,0:12:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过拟态蝇的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.67,0:12:35.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以变成２倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.49,0:12:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再翻倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.07,0:12:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}２倍 ２倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.72,0:12:48.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}转眼之间就变成了３只等级８的怪兽…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.47,0:12:49.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 上吧 海斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.17,0:12:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用３只等级８的感染蝇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.66,0:12:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.66,0:12:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用３只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.80,0:12:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.31,0:13:01.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.41,0:13:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.１！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.65,0:13:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心脏地带)暗黑的振翅声
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.63,0:13:13.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梦幻般地回荡着{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.93,0:13:15.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}惊异的苍蝇之王
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.71,0:13:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}感染·巴阿尔·泽布勒！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.54,0:13:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然是 No.１！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.63,0:13:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}惊讶得连声音都发不出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:34.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有 No.中的第１号！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.68,0:13:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是第一名！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.11,0:13:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那又怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.27,0:13:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚说完“惊得说不出话”你就出声了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.51,0:13:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是召唤 No.1吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.13,0:13:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，铺垫就齐全了……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.70,0:13:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1正是一切的开端。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.93,0:13:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.的顶点。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.94,0:13:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跪伏吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.92,0:14:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出席 No.1 No.1！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.86,0:14:04.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无聊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.25,0:14:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.50,0:14:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要让你尝尝恐怖的制裁！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.78,0:14:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《侵入魔人·巴阿尔·泽布》在
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.62,0:14:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.59,0:14:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方额外卡组的1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.27,0:14:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.05,0:14:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的额外卡组里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.52,0:14:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该有《暗影·蚊》才对。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.75,0:14:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗影·蚊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是从蚊忍者那里夺来的 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.33,0:14:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底要干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.37,0:14:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把那 No.2的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.29,0:14:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗影苔藓送进墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.35,0:14:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.07,0:14:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们至今为止
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.94,0:14:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从巴利安的刺客手中夺走的 No.卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.88,0:14:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都是假的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.74,0:14:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那东西一旦被放入
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.49,0:14:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}扎下根来，被拔除的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.22,0:15:02.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安力场的负荷能量会
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.33,0:15:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}产生数倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.78,0:15:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对身为人类的你来说可是会造成巨大伤害的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.18,0:15:12.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样，快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.74,0:15:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《怎么回事……这股疼痛和冲击是？》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.93,0:15:19.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}越来越有意思了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.59,0:15:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这道光是……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.24,0:15:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安七皇召集的信号？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.57,0:15:30.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖下一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.74,0:15:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦？站起来了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.66,0:15:36.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这才像样，不然就太无聊了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.61,0:15:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别以为这点程度就能了结。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.31,0:15:42.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我为了实现你这家伙的父亲——费卡的梦想{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.31,0:15:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}究竟付出了多少……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.11,0:15:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一个被通缉的小偷{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过是利用我老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.25,0:15:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把他当成藏身之处来用罢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.54,0:15:52.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你……你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.89,0:15:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小偷？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.67,0:15:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是偷偷摸摸偷东西的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.45,0:15:57.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.75,0:16:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动仪式魔法 光子龙降临！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.32,0:16:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仪式召唤吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.89,0:16:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错，发动仪式魔法{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.58,0:16:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将召唤所需的怪兽等级
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.76,0:16:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌或场上解放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.18,0:16:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将怪兽特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.97,0:16:14.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.71,0:16:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级4的 光子充能人解放！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.73,0:16:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仪式召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.38,0:16:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 光子龙骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.80,0:16:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 通过将光子龙骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.15,0:16:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.33,0:16:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌 或卡组{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.32,0:16:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将银河眼光子龙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.41,0:16:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.94,0:16:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降临吧 光之化身！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.91,0:16:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.26,0:16:44.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 银河眼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.63,0:16:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击 侵入魔人·巴阿尔·泽布卢！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.39,0:16:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忘了吗 快斗。No.怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:51.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是 No.怪兽就杀不死。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.38,0:16:53.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可 不好说哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.68,0:16:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.86,0:16:59.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽 进行战斗时
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.04,0:17:01.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与对方怪兽一起被除外！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.33,0:17:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.67,0:17:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此时 被除外的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.97,0:17:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}若是怪兽额外卡组的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:09.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材 全部送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.43,0:17:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 因这个效果被除外的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.08,0:17:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗结束时 回到场上。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.88,0:17:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 回到场上的银河眼{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.57,0:17:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.38,0:17:21.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被送去墓地的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.42,0:17:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 提升500！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.20,0:17:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.41,0:17:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有超量素材的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.39,0:17:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连效果都无法发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.59,0:17:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.55,0:17:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开玩笑的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.87,0:17:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗 很遗憾胜利的方程式 在我手中。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.51,0:17:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在模仿星光体说话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.24,0:17:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖下一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.24,0:17:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}地狱的表演时间到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.18,0:17:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}久等了。怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.31,0:17:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然发紧急召集到底出什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.51,0:18:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.60,0:18:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(梅拉古)好久不见啊，贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.73,0:18:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.33,0:18:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忘了吗？真是薄情呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.38,0:18:16.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《难道那家伙是梅拉古！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.91,0:18:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那另一个人是！？》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.93,0:18:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《纳、纳修！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.97,0:18:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能……你还活着吗！？》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.06,0:18:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.00,0:18:41.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，上啊，快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.06,0:18:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好看着吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.92,0:18:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}感染·邪恶·赛布尔的效果……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.88,0:18:49.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.99,0:18:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次，可以将对方墓地中的 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.88,0:18:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一张变成超量单元！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.36,0:18:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:18:58.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（Mr.心园）我将阴影苔藓{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.38,0:19:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成巴阿尔·泽布尔的超量单元！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.33,0:19:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难受吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.08,0:19:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但我绝不承认什么塞伦达。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.15,0:19:14.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对你这种人，什么塞伦达还不如死了算了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.33,0:19:17.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧。就如你所愿。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.61,0:19:20.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动巴阿尔·泽布尔的进一步效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.62,0:19:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次使用超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.61,0:19:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏对手场上的1张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.74,0:19:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，被破坏的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.39,0:19:30.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是怪兽卡的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.87,0:19:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予玩家其攻击力数值的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.88,0:19:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.28,0:19:39.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵，我要破坏银河眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.55,0:19:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.02,0:19:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去会承受4500的伤害……。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.80,0:19:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马一击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.71,0:19:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.36,0:19:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是你的最后一击了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.56,0:19:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷、陷阱发动！预防抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.16,0:19:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果伤害发生的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.88,0:19:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那伤害……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.36,0:20:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}减半！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.55,0:20:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.83,0:20:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}何等的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.75,0:20:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是贝库塔大人所说的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.55,0:20:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这些 No.卡的强度吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.45,0:20:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.60,0:20:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把从屏障回收的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.70,0:20:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡从卡组丢弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.75,0:20:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有什么蹊跷。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.55,0:20:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦 竟然丢弃 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.88,0:20:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太浪费了 太浪费了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.12,0:20:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？刚才的冲击是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.84,0:20:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张 No.卡……。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.17,0:20:52.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力量！ 哦哦 No.众的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.88,0:20:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}预防抽卡是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.49,0:20:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过效果将伤害减半之后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.42,0:21:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽 抽1张卡…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.03,0:21:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次直接攻击就结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.11,0:21:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.11,0:21:14.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)到此为止了 恶棍！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.89,0:21:19.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才的声音！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.70,0:22:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！ 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.83,0:22:02.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦 小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.73,0:22:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我回来了！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.14,0:23:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.94,0:23:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.23,0:23:49.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.51,0:23:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.12,0:23:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.21,0:23:58.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.82,0:24:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.14,0:24:02.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.26,0:24:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.26,0:24:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
